                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "028f5aac-441f-31b0-8e6d-ac545ceb0aac",
                        "entry_id": "4527f702-f5d5-3d78-96a5-678c577b3cd9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To talk casually, especially in order to gain an advantage or make a social connection."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a55a264-6c1e-454f-afee-2d7617fa6275",
                                "sense_id": "028f5aac-441f-31b0-8e6d-ac545ceb0aac",
                                "text": "I wish he could do his job as well as he schmoozes with the boss."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf982fe4-b1a1-4dbc-b11b-c08c8d36adaf",
                                "sense_id": "028f5aac-441f-31b0-8e6d-ac545ceb0aac",
                                "text": "Until about 4 A.M. there were almost no patients to be seen, and I enjoyed the chance to schmooze with my brother."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "403ac500-9932-4777-adc8-4b5651a59439",
                                "sense_id": "028f5aac-441f-31b0-8e6d-ac545ceb0aac",
                                "text": "But the issue goes beyond that, to a willful ignorance of history. No one schmoozed more or better with legislators in both parties than Clinton."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bcc5fdf3-5aa5-4c43-8310-d6f7cc40a64e",
                                "sense_id": "028f5aac-441f-31b0-8e6d-ac545ceb0aac",
                                "text": "On Thursday he was back in the capitalist hot hub, this time in the company of Goldsmith for a hustings at the home of KPMG organised by the LCCI and other business groups. Who would schmooze the suits to best effect?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "173986bc-52b0-4d42-bb12-0bf67a9f2bc3",
                                "sense_id": "028f5aac-441f-31b0-8e6d-ac545ceb0aac",
                                "text": "On election night, Trump campaign staff set up a war room in Trump’s office at Mar-a-Lago, poring over incoming returns as the candidate schmoozed in the club’s ballroom with Musk and UFC chief Dana White."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0b7735a-4211-487c-95de-68c1bd6c06ce",
                        "source_entry_id": "4527f702-f5d5-3d78-96a5-678c577b3cd9",
                        "source_sense_id": "028f5aac-441f-31b0-8e6d-ac545ceb0aac",
